hadiths[19]{hadithnumber,text}:
"398","[AI-translation] Banu Zamrah ke ek aadmi se apne walid se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai: Aap se fara [janwar ke pehle bachche ki qurbani] ke bare mein poocha gaya. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Beshak fara haq hai [batil nahin]; tum use palo yahan tak ke woh ibnu laboon mote taze [sawari ke qabil] ho jae; tum use bewah ko do ya Allah Azz wa Jall ke raste mein us par sawari do, yeh is se behtar hai ke tumhara bartan undela jae [us ka doodh zae ho], tumhari oontni apne bachche se juda ho, aur tum use khao, jabke us ka gosht us ke baalon se chipka ho [abhi chhota ho].' Shafi'i (Rahimahullah) ne farmaya: Aap ka farman 'Fara haq hai' yani woh batil nahin; lekin yeh Arabi kalam hai jo saail ke jawab par nikla hai."
"399","[AI-translation] Aur Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai: 'Na fara [wajib] hai aur na ateerah [wajib]'; aur yeh riwayat ka ikhtilaf nahin. Balke is ka matlab hai na fara wajib hai aur na ateerah wajib. Aur dusri hadees is ma'na par dalalat karti hai ke Aap ne us ke liye zibah mubah farmaya, aur us ke liye pasand farmaya ke woh use bewah ko de ya Allah ke raste mein us par sawari de. Abu Ja'far kehte hain: Main ne Muzani ko kehte suna: Shafi'i (Rahimahullah) ne farmaya: Ateerah Rajabiyah hai: Woh zabiha hai jise Jahiliyat wale Rajab mein sawab samajh kar karte the. Aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Na ateerah hai', is ma'na par ke na ateerah lazim [wajib] hai. Aur Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka farman jab Aap se ateerah ke bare mein poocha gaya: 'Allah Azz wa Jall ke liye jis mahine mein bhi ho zibah karo, Allah ke liye neki karo, aur khilao', yani agar chaho to zibah karo, aur zabiha Allah ke liye banao, ghair ke liye nahin, aur jis mahine mein bhi ho, na ke woh Rajab mein dusre mahinon ke siwa ho. Aur Abu Ja'far kehte hain: Main ne Muzani ko kehte suna: Shafi'i (Rahimahullah) ne farmaya: Aqiqah woh hai jo log jante hain: Woh zibah hai jo Jahiliyat mein paida hone wale bachche ki taraf se zibah kiya jata tha; Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Islam mein us ka hukm diya, aur us mein se naam ko na-pasand farmaya."
"400","[AI-translation] Zaid bin Aslam ne apni hadees mein kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se aqiqah ke bare mein poocha gaya. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Main uquq [na-farmani se milte julte naam] ko pasand nahin karta; goya Aap ne naam ko na-pasand farmaya. Jis ke han bachcha paida ho aur woh us ki taraf se qurbani karna chahe to kare.'"
"401","[AI-translation] Umm Kurz [Raziyallahu anha] se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Hudaibiyah mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aayi, [sawari se] halki hokar, Aap se hadi ke goshton ke bare mein poochne. To main ne Aap ko farmate suna: 'Ladke ki taraf se do bakriyan, ladki ki taraf se ek bakri; tumhen nuqsan nahin ke woh nar hon ya mada [aqiqah ke janwar].'"
"402","[AI-translation] Main ne unhen [Umm Kurz ko] kehte suna: 'Parindon ko un ke ghonslon par rehne do [shagun ke liye na udao].' Aur main ne Muzani ko kehte suna: Shafi'i (Rahimahullah) ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke farman: 'Parindon ko un ke ghonslon par rehne do' ke bare mein farmaya: Beshak Arabon ka ilm parindon ko udane, [hawa se] shagun lene, lakeer khenchne aur kahin jane mein tha: Un mein se ek jab subah apne ghar se kisi kaam ke liye nikalta to pehle parinde ko dekhta jo woh dekhta; agar woh us ke baen se nikal kar us ke dayen se guzarta to kehta: Yeh dayen wala parinda [achcha shagun] hai; woh apni hajat mein aage badhta aur gumaan karta ke kamyab hoga. Agar woh us ke dayen se nikal kar us ke baen se guzarta to kehta: Yeh baen wala parinda [bura shagun] hai; woh wapas lautta aur kehta: Yeh manhoos hajat hai. Hutai'ah ne Abu Musa Ash'ari (Raziyallahu anhu) ki tareef mein kaha: Woh parindon ko shagun ke liye nahin udata jab woh us ke samne aayen, aur qismat ke teeron se hissa nahin banta, yani us ne Allah Azz wa Jall par tawakkul mein Islam ka rasta apnaya. Ba'z shairon ne apni tareef mein kaha: Aur main un mein se nahin jo parinde udate hain apni khwahish ke liye: Kya kawwe ne aawaz di ya lomdi samne aayi. Arabi jab udta hua parinda na dekhta aur ghonsle mein parinda dekhta to use ghonsle se harkat deta taake use uda kar dekhe: Kya woh manhoos raste par chala ya achche raste par? To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke farman: 'Parindon ko un ke ghonslon par rehne do' ka matlab hai unhen harkat na do; unhen harkat dena aur jo tum us se shagun jante ho kuch nahin karta; sirf woh karta hai jis ki taraf tum mutawajjah ho Allah Azz wa Jall ka faisla."
"403","[AI-translation] Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se tiyarah [bura shagun lene] ke bare mein poocha gaya; to Aap ne farmaya: 'Yeh sirf woh hai jo tum mein se koi apne nafs mein pata hai; to tumhen [apni hajaton se] na roke.'"
"404","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Use [chand] dekhe baghair roza na rakho, aur use dekhe baghair iftar na karo. Phir agar tum par badal chha jae to ginti tees poori karo.' Abdullah us se ek din pehle roza rakhte. Main ne kaha: Kya tum us se pehle [roza rakh kar] aage badhte ho? Unhon ne kaha: Ji."
"405","[AI-translation] Ibn Marjanah (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abbas se zikr kiya gaya ke Ibn Umar ne yeh ayat padhi: ﴿وَإِنْ تُبْدُوا مَا فِي أَنْفُسِكُمْ أَوْ تُخْفُوهُ يُحَاسِبْكُمْ بِهِ اللَّهُ﴾ [Al-Baqarah: 284]; woh roe phir kaha: Allah ki qasam, agar Allah ham se is par muakhaza farmaye to ham halak ho jayenge. To Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Allah Abu Abdir Rahman par rehem farmaye; beshak Musalmanon ne us se jab woh nazil hui waisa paya jaisa unhon ne paya; unhon ne is ka zikr Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kiya, phir nazil hui: ﴿لَا يُكَلِّفُ اللَّهُ نَفْسًا إِلَّا وُسْعَهَا لَهَا مَا كَسَبَتْ وَعَلَيْهَا مَا اكْتَسَبَتْ﴾ [Al-Baqarah: 286] qaul aur amal se; jabke nafs ka waswasa us mein se hai jis ka koi malik nahin aur jis par koi qadir nahin."
"406","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: 'Jab aadmi apni biwi ko talaq de to woh us ki taraf ruju ka zyada haqdar hai yahan tak ke woh teesri haiz ke ghusl tak [pehli aur dusri talaq mein].' Aur Sufyan bin Uyainah ne ham ko khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Mansur ne Ibrahim se Alqamah se Umar aur Abdullah bin Mas'ud se aisi hi khabar di. Main ne Sufyan bin Uyainah ko Ayyub bin Abi Tamimah Sakhtiyani se Hasan bin Abi Hasan se Abu Musa Ash'ari se Ali, Umar aur Abdullah ki hadees jaise ma'na [bayan karte] suna."
"407","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir [Raziyallahu anhu] se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne [paidawar ki] salon wali bae [bai-us-sinin] se mana farmaya, aur afat [jawaih] [ki wajah se qeemat] dalne ka hukm diya."
"408","[AI-translation] Sufyan kehte hain: Abu Zubair ne ham ko Jabir se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se aisi hi khabar di. Abu Ja'far kehte hain: Main ne Muzani ko kehte suna: Shafi'i (Rahimahullah) ne farmaya: Sufyan is hadees ko bayan karte aur us mein 'jawaih dalne' ka zikr nahin farmate; unhon ne kaha: Main ne 'jawaih dalne' ko is liye nahin chhora ke woh hadees mein nahin; lekin 'jawaih dalne' se pehle kalam tha jo mujhe yaad nahin raha."
"409","[AI-translation] Zuhri (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Iraq wale gumaan karte hain ke qazif [zina ki jhooti tohmat lagane wale] ki gawahi jaiz nahin; main gawahi deta hun ke mujhe Sa'id bin Musayyib ne khabar di ke Umar bin Khattab ne Abu Bakrah se kaha: 'Tauba kar, tumhari gawahi qabool ki jaegi; ya agar tum tauba karo to tumhari gawahi qabool ki jaegi.' Woh use aise hi kai martaba bayan karte; phir main ne unhen kehte suna: Mujhe us mein shak hua. Zuhri ne kaha: Us ne mujhe khabar di; jab main khada hua to main ne poocha; mujh se Umar ne kaha, jo mere sath majlis mein hazir tha, woh Sa'id bin Musayyib the. Main ne Sufyan se kaha: Kya tumhen us mein shak hua jab us ne tumhen khabar di ke woh Sa'id hain? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin, woh jaisa us ne kaha; magar mujhe shak dakhil hua tha. Abu Ja'far ne ham se kaha: Yeh Umar, Umar bin Qais hain jo Humaid bin Qais ke bhai hain jin ke bare mein Malik ne kaha; woh hadees mein zaeef hain, woh un ki hadees mein kalam karte hain. Un se Malik bin Anas, Ibn Uyainah aur Abdul-Waris bin Sa'id Tannuri ne riwayat ki; yeh Umar Sandal ke naam se jane jate hain."
"410","[AI-translation] Madinah walon mein se jin par main bharosa karta hun us se Ibn Shihab se Sa'id bin Musayyib se riwayat hai ke Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne jab teen aadmiyon ko kode lagaye to un se tauba mangi; do wapas aae [tauba ki] to unhon ne un dono ki gawahi qabool ki; Abu Bakrah ne wapas aane se inkar kiya to unhon ne us ki gawahi radd ki."
"411","[AI-translation] Ibn Abi Najih se qazif jab tauba kare ke bare mein riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Us ki gawahi qabool ki jati hai. Unhon ne kaha: Ham sab kehte hain: Ata, Taus aur Mujahid. Tahawi ne ham ko khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Muzani ko kehte suna: Shafi'i (Rahimahullah) ne farmaya: 'Qazi ke liye [jaiz] nahin ke woh aadmi ko amanat lene par majboor kare.'"
"412","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: 'Jab aadmi apni biwi ko talaq de to woh us ki taraf ruju ka zyada haqdar hai yahan tak ke woh teesri haiz ke ghusl tak [pehli aur dusri talaq mein].'"
"413","[AI-translation] Mansur se Ibrahim se Alqamah se Umar aur Abdullah bin Mas'ud se aisi hi riwayat hai."
"414","[AI-translation] Hasan bin Abi Hasan se Abu Musa Ash'ari se Ali, Umar aur Abdullah ki hadees jaise ma'na ki riwayat hai."
"415","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne nar [janwar ki jima ki] ujrat [qebmat] se mana farmaya."
"416","[AI-translation] Abu Zubair se Jabir se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se aise hi ma'na ki riwayat hai."
